{"material_id":"mat_ec57c99a6a09","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"kzwj96fvnn3whzvnhqdvsh830","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"黄仁勋回归后 Nvidia 仍面临 Megaspeed 芯片出口合规调查","excerpt":"TechCrunch 分析指出，黄仁勋回归 Nvidia CEO 后，公司仍面临多方对其 GPU 出口合规问题的调查。新加坡数据中心运营商 Megaspeed 被指违反美国出口管制，将先进 GPU 转运至中国。美国司法部于 2024 年启动调查，新加坡方面于 2025 年展开类似调查，加州总检察长办公室及美国证券交易委员会也关注 Nvidia 的相关披露。Nvidia 表示将停止向中国销售许可芯片，并计划设立首席合规官及董事会出口管制委员会。","source_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/the-questions-jensen-huang-and-nvidia-will-still-have-to-answer-about-megaspeed/","canonical_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/the-questions-jensen-huang-and-nvidia-will-still-have-to-answer-about-megaspeed","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-25T13:00:00.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-26T09:15:33.035Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":55,"fingerprint":"ec57c99a6a096767a36e20537bebae03846efdb61fdabfbba8cf3b54f4165330","content_fingerprint":"b5b73d473e03b88d0cdc5b626eb6aa70bbe2176da55830d340e7edf5708acacf"}
{"material_id":"mat_69fbec9981f8","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"h1ja45355xx1xf9rqf89cv1if","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","author_followers":null,"title":"Anthropic 复盘 Messages API 从 Python 迁移到 Rust 的校验方法","excerpt":"Anthropic 介绍如何将 Messages API 从 Python 迁移到 Rust，并把生产系统本身当作校验器。该 API 流量从 2024 年初到 2026 年秋增长约 1800 倍，迁移后每请求 CPU 降低约 70%，首 token 中位时间缩短约 20%，且未停服或冻结功能开发。","source_url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/migrating-api-to-rust","canonical_url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/migrating-api-to-rust","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-24T16:00:00.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-26T09:15:33.035Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_coding","ai_news"],"relevance_score":37,"freshness_score":80,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":56,"fingerprint":"69fbec9981f84b435a9deadb2f44143e2e52e655849d0255056557c8b934cbaf","content_fingerprint":"0b94c47063e3c8db47416ba2139a053ac2b2c8eadcb12dc5bfce07a79219e631"}
{"material_id":"mat_1d745c417e84","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"e6gp31eup40d99unaon9umnpo","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Elon Musk (@elonmusk, xAI)","author_followers":null,"title":"Dario Amodei 澄清不主张向 AI 交出人类自由意志","excerpt":"Anthropic 的 Dario Amodei 发长文否认其主张“向 AI 交出人类自由意志”，称其文章一贯主张 AI 须受合法民主程序治理。他区分了全球治理层面的交权与具体任务的自动化，后者持混合态度，包括对递归自我改进设限、警惕端到端部署带来的就业冲击，并称 Anthropic 曾拒绝让自家模型用于自主武器；文末批评部分 AI CEO 只喊“人类控制”等口号而无实质行动。Elon Musk 转发并评论 Interesting。","source_url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2125669066388209784","canonical_url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2125669066388209784","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-25T19:12:53.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-26T09:15:33.035Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Elon Musk (@elonmusk, xAI)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news","automation"],"relevance_score":40,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":63,"fingerprint":"1d745c417e84dc7ab7cb080021c8f6a6ce048858e3bb8ee2e446938b19047144","content_fingerprint":"1ece3b5529825e24ac83793f614af7520ca01ad929865b0e4b5d5e9988f325a0"}
{"material_id":"mat_09eaf6f0432e","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"ogucsvlqrdr1rvfh5nvx757cx","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：面壁智能 OpenBMB (@OpenBMB)","author_followers":null,"title":"面壁智能等发布 EVIL 基准，测出 GPT-4o 等模型在违法场景下安全率不足","excerpt":"面壁智能（OpenBMB）团队在 Nature Communications 发表 EVIL 研究，基于中美数千真实判例构建 269 个违法场景 × 50 种违法意图，测试 10 个前沿模型。多数模型安全率低于 75%，GPT-4o 在两种法律语境下均低于 60%，近半违法请求会获得协助；带特定人口身份暗示的请求更易得到协助，用现有安全对齐数据做 SFT 和 DPO 不能修复，某些设置下反而加重。","source_url":"https://x.com/OpenBMB/status/2125575267217531181","canonical_url":"https://x.com/OpenBMB/status/2125575267217531181","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-25T13:00:09.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-26T09:15:33.035Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：面壁智能 OpenBMB (@OpenBMB)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_news"],"relevance_score":35,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":60,"fingerprint":"09eaf6f0432e454b468b837b58c427f4721941f71ae4002cfcb5883603dedde9","content_fingerprint":"d3a7045c70e2e88acd3c490c84848a1b231392d725b69692e1fe9d2b21768bda"}
